  "method": {
    "eyes": "Raster 12x12 samples from actual skinned white/iris/pupil/arc eye triangles; projected headgear triangle depths with material side and expanded outline; samples have not been filtered for eyelid/self-skull occlusion, so screenshot confirmation is required.",
    "ears": "Triangle edge intersections with actual skinned ear outer/inner/outline surfaces; coplanar pairs are not diagnosed. Crossings around ear base can be intended mounting and require visual judgment.",
    "bounds": "All actual skinned vertices including baked outlines; headgear raw vertices plus normal-expanded shader outlines; renderer FRAME. buildCat3D and HEADGEAR share one bundled live registry for trustworthy baseline comparisons."
  },
  "limitations": [
    "眼部在实际蒙皮三角投影到世界+z正交观看平面后做12×12采样，按材质正反面/描边深度比较；没有过滤眼睑或自身头骨，因此与实际截图联合判断，非任意像素/视角证明。",
    "耳部采用实际非共面三角边相交；共面重叠不诊断，低位隐蔽佩戴接合需要实际普通/峰/背向图判断。",
    "14姿势t=.4、三姿势12时刻和phase0精确耳内摆峰是有限样本，非所有连续时刻和任意相位证明。",
    "独立20用户联系表用透明截图alpha bbox裁切后等比高190px；官方w250截图保持原生canvas250×219，人物高近似190px；真实battle另核对。"
  ],
  "leastSatisfied": "叶帽strike现在有有色背面，190px背脉和叶片厚度仍弱，剪影偏薄；idle/windup的叶面与短柄更清楚。",
